      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/qedushah/echad_hu_eloheinu" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n242.jpg">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/qedushah/echad_hu_eloheinu/echad_hu"/>One is our God, He is our <tei:choice><j:option corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:amidah/qedushah/echad_hu_eloheinu/echad_hu/father_full_stop_king_capital" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n242.jpg">father. He is our King, He is our helper,</j:option><j:option corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:amidah/qedushah/echad_hu_eloheinu/echad_hu/father_comma_king_lowercase" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n246.jpg">father, He is our king, He is our helper;</j:option></tei:choice> He will again let us hear in His mercy before the eyes of all the living: <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="15" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/qedushah/echad_hu_eloheinu/quotations/numbers_15"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/qedushah/echad_hu_eloheinu/quotations/numbers_15/41" n="41"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/15/41">‘To be God unto you’.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
